an endless wave of skeletons, surviving for as long as you can.\n\nSingle-player. Free to play.\n\nStatistics package available for in-app purchase to track your progress over time.\n\nPrimarily created for standing play, since skeletons spawn in a 360 degree circle around the player. However, it could be played in a swivel chair.\n\nEnjoy :)\n\nJoin the SkeleSlayer Discord! https://discord.gg/Yc6UQ5CVRq", "short_description": "A sword-swinging, skeleton-slaying fitness and arcade game. Enhance your physical and cognitive fitness level in a fun, engaging way. Slash your way through an endless wave of skeletons, surviving for as long as you can.\n\nSingle-player. Free to play.\n\nStatistics package available for in-app purchase to track your progress over time.\n\nPrimarily created for standing play, since skeletons spawn in a 360 degree circle around the player. However, it could be played in a swivel chair.\n\nEnjoy :)"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://maddyv.xyz/skeleslayer-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "XRchitect Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://maddyv.xyz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28087865887477927"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2421967671643044"}]}, "b